    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Messages posted by the website when a WhatsApp order is paid.\n// Set your WhatsApp phone number ID here (Meta > WhatsApp > API Setup).\nconst PHONE_NUMBER_ID = 'REPLACE_WITH_PHONE_NUMBER_ID';\nconst body = $input.first().json.body ?? {};\nreturn (body.messages ?? []).map(message => ({ json: { phoneNumberId: PHONE_NUMBER_ID, to: body.to, message } }));"
      },
      "id": "1b0d7469-5bc9-49af-8bd7-44584ea6e441",
      "name": "Paid messages",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        220,
        760
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Rich G WhatsApp sales bot\n\n**Before activating, replace:**\n1. `REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_VERIFY_TOKEN` in *Verify token OK?*: any string, also entered in Meta's webhook settings.\n2. `REPLACE_WITH_PHONE_NUMBER_ID` in *Paid messages*.\n3. `REPLACE_WITH_STAFF_NUMBER…` in *Alert staff*.\n4. If the site isn't on richgcollection.com, change the URL in *Ask website bot*.\n\n**Credentials (Header Auth):**\n- *WhatsApp Cloud API token*: Name `Authorization`, Value `Bearer <permanent system-user token>`\n- *RichG Bot API key*: Name `Authorization`, Value `Bearer <BOT_API_KEY from the site's env>`\n\nMeta callback URL = Production URL of *WhatsApp inbound*, e.g. `https://n8n.yourdomain.com/webhook/richg-whatsapp`. Subscribe the **messages** field.",
        "height": 560,
        "width": 380
      },
      "id": "6c9755d0-a32b-452f-8afe-564b55f33e5d",
      "name": "Note: Setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -420,
        -120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "All shopping logic (catalog, stock reservations, cart, checkout, Paystack link) runs on the website at `/api/bot/message`. n8n receives WhatsApp messages, forwards them, and sends back the replies in order.\n\nPayment is confirmed by the website's existing Paystack webhook. The site then posts to *Order paid* and n8n sends the confirmation.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 520
      },
      "id": "33a392fa-6f98-4734-ae4e-c9d67c27a648",
      "name": "Note: Flow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        600,
        -140
      ]
    }
